    note: >-
      One of the very last runs featuring frontman Craig Owens before the band
      parted ways with him just weeks later in September 2009 (Owens was
      captured in personal photos from this stop).
  - band: A Day to Remember
    note: >-
      Breaking wide open behind Homesick (February 2009), turning afternoon sets
      into massive sing-along pits.
  - band: The Devil Wears Prada
    note: >-
      Fresh off the May 2009 release of With Roots Above and Branches Below,
      which debuted at #11 on the Billboard 200.
  - band: All Time Low
    note: >-
      Celebrating the July 7, 2009 release of Nothing Personal, their #4
      Billboard breakout.
  - band: Bad Religion
    note: >-
      Approaching their 30th anniversary as punk institutions between New Maps
